otiation"},{"text":"Priority identification"},{"text":"Alternative suppliers"},{"text":"Package optimisation"},{"text":"Sponsorship"},{"text":"Cost comparison"},{"text":"Non-critical expense reduction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Scenario 3 — Guest management"},{"type":"p","text":"A VIP speaker arrives late and the programme is already running."},{"type":"p","text":"The candidate should demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Schedule flexibility"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Hospitality"},{"text":"Coordination with stage/production"},{"text":"Alternative programme sequencing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Scenario 4 — Event analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"2,000 people registered but only 1,250 attended. How would you analyse the problem?"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible metrics:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Registration-to-attendance conversion"},{"text":"Reminder effectiveness"},{"text":"Audience segmentation"},{"text":"No-show rate"},{"text":"Event timing"},{"text":"Location/accessibility"},{"text":"Registration source"},{"text":"Communication engagement"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Event Management"},{"text":"MBA Marketing"},{"text":"MBA Operations"},{"text":"MBA Hospitality Management"},{"text":"MBA/PGDM Business Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MA Public Relations"},{"text":"MA Advertising"},{"text":"MA Mass Communication"},{"text":"MA Corporate Communication"},{"text":"MA Media Studies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialised"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Event Management"},{"text":"MICE Management"},{"text":"Hospitality Management"},{"text":"Sports Management"},{"text":"Media & Entertainment Management"},{"text":"Digital Marketing"},{"text":"Brand Management"},{"text":"Experiential Marketing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"An MBA is not mandatory for becoming an Event Executive; practical event experience and execution skills are often more immediately valuable at entry level."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant master's programmes include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Event Management"},{"text":"International Event Management"},{"text":"Hospitality Management"},{"text":"Tourism & Events"},{"text":"Sports Event Management"},{"text":"Festival & Cultural Management"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Public Relations"},{"text":"Strategic Communications"},{"text":"Experiential Marketing"},{"text":"Media & Entertainment Management"},{"text":"Business/Event Analytics"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"0–2 years"},{"type":"h","text":"Event Intern → Event Executive"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Event execution"},{"text":"Vendors"},{"text":"Registration"},{"text":"Guest handling"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2–5 years"},{"type":"flow","items":["Event Executive","Senior Event Executive","Event Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Client management"},{"text":"Budget"},{"text":"Team leadership"},{"text":"Multiple vendors"},{"text":"Event strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5–8 years"},{"type":"h","text":"Event Manager → Senior Event Manager / Operations Manager"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Large events"},{"text":"P&L"},{"text":"Sponsorship"},{"text":"Strategic accounts"},{"text":"Team management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"8–12+ years"},{"type":"h","text":"Event Director / Head of Events / Agency Founder"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business development"},{"text":"Large accounts"},{"text":"Brand strategy"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Partnerships"},{"text":"Leadership"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 Career Evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"The Event Executive role will increasingly combine human 